<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dental Appointment Bot Demo</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#0a0a0a;
    color:white;
}

.container{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:50px 20px;
}

h1{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.subtitle{
    text-align:center;
    color:#aaa;
    margin-bottom:50px;
}

.chat-box{
    background:#151515;
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:30px;
    max-width:700px;
    margin:auto;
}

.message{
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:10px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    max-width:80%;
}

.user{
    background:#8b5cf6;
    margin-left:auto;
}

.bot{
    background:#222;
}

.workflow{
    margin-top:60px;
    text-align:center;
}

.step{
    background:#151515;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    margin:15px auto;
    max-width:300px;
}

.arrow{
    font-size:30px;
    color:#8b5cf6;
}

.back-btn{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:40px;
    background:#8b5cf6;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:12px 24px;
    border-radius:8px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>🦷 Dental Appointment Booking Bot</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
Demo automation for dental clinics.
</p>

<div class="chat-box">

<div class="message user">
Can I book a cleaning on Friday?
</div>

<div class="message bot">
Friday is fully booked.
</div>

<div class="message bot">
Available times:
<br><br>
10:00 AM
<br>
1:00 PM
<br>
4:00 PM
</div>

<div class="message user">
1 PM works for me.
</div>

<div class="message bot">
Perfect! Your appointment has been booked.
</div>

<div class="message bot">
A confirmation email has been sent.
</div>

</div>

<div class="workflow">

<h2>Automation Workflow</h2>

<div class="step">
🤖 AI Chatbot
</div>

<div class="arrow">↓</div>

<div class="step">
📅 Google Calendar
</div>

<div class="arrow">↓</div>

<div class="step">
📧 Confirmation Email
</div>

<div class="arrow">↓</div>

<div class="step">
✅ Appointment Confirmed
</div>

</div>

<div style="text-align:center;">
<a href="index.html" class="back-btn">
← Back To Portfolio
</a>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
